Package: sumgamma
Type: Package
Title: Fast, High-Precision Distribution Functions for Sums of Gamma Variables
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Given", "Family", , "author@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
  )
Description: Provides ultra-fast, high-precision distribution functions (CDF, PDF,
    quantile, and random variate generation) for the convolution of arbitrary
    independent, non-identical Gamma random variables. Implements three complementary
    numerical architectures: 1) Singularity-adapted saddlepoint contour integration with
    Wynn's epsilon acceleration and suffix-moment Taylor expansions for exact evaluation
    across extreme tails; 2) 80-bit extended-precision Radix-2 FFT Moschopoulos infinite
    mixture series expansions; and 3) Richardson leave-half-out adaptive Hyman monotonic
    splines with guaranteed error bounds for sub-microsecond vector evaluation.
License: GPL (>= 3)
